{"_v":3,"id":"instructions-for-a-teenage-armageddon-west-end-2024","cat":"west-end","cs":60.81,"rc":6,"bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":4,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Dave Fargnoli","o":"The Stage","s":57,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/instructions-for-a-teenage-armageddon-review-garrick-theatre-london-rosie-day-georgie-staight-charithra-chandran","d":"2024-03-18","q":"Despite the compelling sincerity...production lacks the energy and bite"},{"cn":"Kate Wyver","o":"The Guardian","s":56,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2024/mar/18/instructions-for-a-teenage-armageddon-review-garrick-theatre-london-charithra-chandran","d":"2024-03-18","q":"The production longs for a little more of the wildly ambitious, teen-fuelled nihilism"},{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":39,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/instructions-for-a-teenage-armageddon-review-garrick-theatre-bridgerton-charithra-chandran-b1145687.html","d":"2024-03-18"},{"cn":"Greg Stewart","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://theatreweekly.com/review-instructions-for-a-teenage-armageddon-at-the-garrick-theatre/","d":"2024-03-17","q":"And a demanding role it is too, for this is an eighty minute monologue which rarely takes its foot off of the pedal."},{"cn":"Julia Rank","o":"London Theatre","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/instructions-for-a-teenage-armageddon-review-garrick-theatre","d":"2024-03-18","q":"Anyone who has ever been a teenage girl and felt ignored will find plenty to empathise"},{"cn":"Cindy Marcolina","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":57,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/westend/article/Review-INSTRUCTIONS-FOR-A-TEENAGE-ARMAGEDDON-Garrick-Theatre-20240318","d":"2024-03-18","q":"...it’s a heartbreaking depiction of teenage depression"}],"pd":"2024-03-17"}